      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Only the static host, the API and the identity provider are reachable from the internet. There is no separate agent\ncontainer. Notifications are in-app only - v1.0.0 sends no email or SMS. Local development runs ThunderID and\nPostgreSQL with docker-compose and the API with `make backend`.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Only the static host, the API and the identity provider are reachable from the internet. There is no separate agent\ncontainer. Notifications are in-app only - v1.0.0 sends no email or SMS. Local development runs ThunderID and\nPostgreSQL with docker-compose and the API with `make backend`.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 13
